WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.055
Step nine. Mobile versus web.

2
00:00:03.055 --> 00:00:10.035
It's the same app in two layouts. On wide screens you get the web app. On a phone, you get the mobile app.

3
00:00:10.035 --> 00:00:16.610
The web app has a sidebar, wide tables, and the form side by side with the live estimate.

4
00:00:16.610 --> 00:00:25.574
The mobile app has bottom tabs, cards instead of tables, and wallets in a bottom sheet. You can switch layouts any time from the menu.

